&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Our client is a values-driven organization in the healthcare space, guided by the principles of caring, candor, and high performance. They are seeking someone who welcomes feedback, adapts their approach based on team input, and brings both conviction and humility to collaborative problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;if this sounds right for you, use the form below to apply!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cheesy joke to get you to smile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;svelte-x57wqa&quot;&gt;Two SQL transactions ask a minister to marry them, but the minister replies, &quot;Only if you&#39;re willing to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;svelte-x57wqa&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;svelte-x57wqa&quot;&gt;commit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;svelte-x57wqa&quot;&gt;.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a hands-on Data Engineer who is skilled in building complex systems beyond just writing queries. This role focuses on SQL Server in both Linux and Windows environments and requires versatility across various tools, including PowerShell, APIs, Python, and emerging AI/LLM technologies. If you enjoy stretching your expertise beyond SQL and want to contribute to innovative solutions, this position is for you. The role is for one of our North American clients with proprietary software for the insurance industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and optimize complex SQL Server solutions, emphasizing performance tuning, indexing, and data modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relational and semi-structured data, including JSON stored in SQL Server and multi-dimensional datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query and transform JSON using native SQL Server tools, such as OPENJSON and JSON_VALUE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use PowerShell, SQL Server tools, and scripting to automate processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance functionalities by integrating with APIs and external systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address problems comprehensively, focusing on end-to-end solutions beyond the database layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate within a complex, multi-system application environment, avoiding isolated reporting or analytics tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and implement LLM-driven workflows, including prompting and structured outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously enhance efficiency by replacing manual processes with automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in SQL Server, including query performance, indexing, and data modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling JSON in SQL Server and managing hybrid data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PowerShell or similar scripting languages for automation purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across multiple systems, including databases, APIs, and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to deliver effective solutions in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in smaller teams with end-to-end system ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in complex application environments rather than isolated reporting or analytics settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability to navigate and solve problems without detailed requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in insurance, financial services, or other regulated, transaction-heavy domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python experience and familiarity with APIs and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LLMs like OpenAI and Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing internal tools or automation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud or hybrid infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position, offering the flexibility to work from anywhere. If you are ready to take ownership and thrive in a fast-paced, adaptive environment, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There are only two hard problems in computer science: cache invalidation, naming things, and convincing an ERP that &quot;Acme Corp.&quot; and &quot;ACME Corporation&quot; are the same vendor.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that joke hurt a little, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DistantJob is looking for a Senior .NET Integration Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join one of our clients, a fintech company whose platform automates accounts payable, payments and financial operations for investment firms, family offices and fund administrators. Their customers rely on the platform to connect with the accounting systems they already use, so the integration layer is central to the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design, build and own the integrations that link the platform to ERP and accounting systems such as NetSuite, QuickBooks, Sage and Microsoft Dynamics. You&#39;ll work closely with a Staff Engineer and take real ownership, from scoping through production. You&#39;ll spend your time on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and improving REST and SOAP integrations that hold up against messy real-world customer setups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing sync, mapping, validation and reconciliation workflows that keep data accurate between systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling partial failures, retries and eventual consistency, with idempotency and audit trails built in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving performance and reliability, adding logging and alerting, and finding the root cause when an integration breaks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the onboarding and support teams to get customers connected and live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to code reviews, documentation and engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team is also actively adopting AI-assisted development with tools like Cursor, Claude Code and GitHub Copilot, so you&#39;ll have room to work that way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering with production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong C# and .NET, including backend services and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience integrating with ERP, accounting or financial systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of REST and SOAP, including authentication, error handling, retries and versioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data synchronization, transformation and reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL Server skills: query design, optimization and data modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven or message-based architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independence and clear communication with both engineers and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on NetSuite, QuickBooks, Sage or Dynamics integration work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in fintech, payments, AP or fund administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure experience (Service Bus, Functions, API Management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SFTP, EDI or file-based integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for scripting and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-tenant SaaS experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observability practices such as structured logging and tracing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI coding tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Details&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Fully remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt; US business hours, Central time preferred but can work in Eastern time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time and long-term&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off:&lt;/strong&gt; 10 paid vacation days and 8 paid national holidays per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why this one?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the integration layer of a growing platform, not just pick tickets off a backlog. The team collaborates closely, and the company is serious about its engineering standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to make two systems agree on something?&lt;/strong&gt; Apply and one of our recruiters will be in touch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these qualifications and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic team, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Looking for someone who knows that PPC doesn&#39;t stand for &#39;Pretty Please Click&#39; but can make people do exactly that!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re seeking a results-driven Senior PPC Specialist to join our client&#39;s digital marketing team. You&#39;ll develop and execute high-performance paid search and social campaigns in this role that drive measurable business outcomes. You&#39;ll be responsible for strategy development, campaign optimization, data analysis, and cross-functional collaboration to achieve our marketing objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Build full-funnel paid search and social strategies aligned with pipeline, CAC, and LTV targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Size opportunities and forecast ROI for campaign initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Create effective account structures and roadmaps for performance improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Launch, monitor, and A/B test campaigns across Google, Microsoft, and emerging platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement in CTR, CVR, ROAS, and impression share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Optimize budget allocation and implement new platform features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysis &amp;amp; Insight (about 15% of your time)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Use GA4 and Looker to identify performance trends and actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Translate complex data into compelling narratives for senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Develop reporting that highlights key metrics and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Innovation (about 10% of your time)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Partner with Creative on ad copy and visual concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Coach junior team members on PPC best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Recommend new tools, betas, and channels worth piloting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;2-5+ years of hands-on experience managing Google Ads campaigns (Search, Shopping, P-Max) and Google Tag Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Demonstrated proficiency with bid automation strategies (Target ROAS, tCPA), audience segmentation, and feed management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Proven track record of meeting or exceeding aggressive CAC, ROAS, or revenue goals in both B2B and B2C environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Strong analytical capabilities with expertise in Excel, Looker/Power BI, and performance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Growth mindset with a commitment to iteration, documentation, and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to translate technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, or related field (or equivalent practical experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Experience managing paid social campaigns across multiple platforms (LinkedIn, Meta, TikTok, Reddit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Advertising platform and strategies&lt;/li&gt;
