&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Industry certifications (Google Ads, Analytics, Meta Blueprint, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with diverse clients&lt;/li&gt;
