&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these qualifications and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic team, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;Garbage in, garbage out.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; (a computing maxim often credited to IBM instructor George Fuechsel)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our client&#39;s platform is built on the opposite idea: messy vendor data goes in, and clean, trustworthy records come out. We&#39;re looking for the engineer who will own that transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DistantJob, we&#39;re searching for a Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer for one of our U.S.-based clients. They&#39;re building a platform that cleans, matches and unifies vendor data for many client firms, then feeds it to their payment products through an API. The engineer who joins will take real ownership of that platform alongside the Tech Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a &quot;pick up tickets and wait for instructions&quot; role. You&#39;ll shape how the platform is designed and shipped, from the first scoping conversation to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, building and running the platform end to end, across backend and frontend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining the APIs other systems rely on, plus the screens operators use every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning vendor data mastering, matching, deduplication and reconciliation, and the data-quality checks that keep records trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling the platform across many client tenants and growing data volumes, including asynchronous and event-driven processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Tech Lead on architecture and with product on priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping quality high through code reviews, tests and a disciplined development process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering, with real production ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and modern API development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend experience with Angular or React, and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid SQL and relational data modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience with Azure or AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multi-tenant or multi-client systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven or message-based architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The independence to own work from design to production, partner closely with product, and keep up in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large, messy datasets: matching, deduplication, transformation and reconciliation across sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in payments, accounts payable, fintech or fund administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with entity resolution, record linkage, and AI-assisted matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of AI development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tech you&#39;ll work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Python, TypeScript (Angular or React), SQL, Azure or AWS, REST APIs, event-driven architectures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The setup&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote, long-term, full-time position (8 hours a day, 5 days a week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working hours aligned with U.S. business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct integration into the client&#39;s engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ready to apply?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send us your resume using the form below! No news isn&#39;t bad news, it&#39;s just a queue that hasn&#39;t been processed yet. We review every application, and if your profile is a match, we&#39;ll reach out to you directly to set up a first conversation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot; style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Q - What did the DBA say to the Developer?&lt;br&gt;A - It doesn&#39;t matter, he wasn&#39;t listening anyway&lt;br&gt;Q - What did the Developer say to the DBA?&lt;br&gt;A - It doesn&#39;t matter, the answer is &quot;No&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enough with the humor! Let&#39;s get to the point.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DistantJob is hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior SQL DBA&lt;/strong&gt; for one of our clients, a growing US-based SaaS company serving 150+ enterprise clients on a highly customized, multi-tenant platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a &quot;big data&quot; role — the databases themselves are modest in size. The real challenge is complexity: each client runs on their own database instance, and while most of the schema and logic is standardized, a meaningful portion is customized per client. That means no two performance issues look exactly alike, and a one-size-fits-all runbook doesn&#39;t cut it here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for critical database issues during US business hours, diagnosing and resolving performance, reliability, and availability problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with developers to design, review, and optimize SQL queries, stored procedures, and database logic — and coach the team on performance best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor database health across client environments, building alerting thresholds, runbooks, and dashboards to catch risks before they become incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the database side of test-environment readiness — syncing test databases, validating configuration, and building automation to reduce manual setup work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve database-related pull requests, maintaining coding standards and evaluating changes for performance, risk, and backward compatibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform routine database maintenance (backups, patching, capacity planning) during business hours to avoid production disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document recurring issues, resolutions, and operational procedures for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience as a DBA, with real production support experience — not purely development-side database work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL Server / T-SQL skills, including query optimization and execution plan analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across highly customized, multi-instance environments rather than a single standardized database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in both reactive incident response and proactive, collaborative dev support — this role is a mix of both, and that balance is expected to shift over time as processes mature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure and .NET/ORM familiarity a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt; Primarily CST hours (EST also considered) — this role exists specifically to extend coverage into the US afternoon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll join a team that&#39;s intentional about long-term growth for this position — not just filling a support ticket queue, but building someone into a trusted, embedded part of the development process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these qualifications and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic team, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;“Why did the microservice get promoted?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because it scaled under pressure.”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;We are recruiting a seasoned DevOps Engineer for one of our valued clients, an innovative technology company&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;specializing in AI-powered brand safety and contextual intelligence solutions. This role focuses on building and maintaining the robust infrastructure foundation that supports their advanced data analytics and content measurement platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will design, secure, and optimize the operational systems that enable scalable, high-performance applications. This is a pivotal role for someone passionate about automation, system ownership, and creating resilient infrastructure solutions from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and maintain secure, scalable cloud infrastructure for high-throughput, low-latency applications (mainly AWS, with flexibility for multi-cloud environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Develop and enhance CI/CD pipelines for efficient, reliable, and consistent deployment processes (GitHub Actions and similar tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Continuously identify and implement infrastructure improvements across the entire product ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Architect and support serverless solutions using AWS Lambda, ECS Fargate, and event-driven architecture components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Establish comprehensive monitoring, alerting, and logging frameworks to ensure system reliability and visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Manage infrastructure-as-code implementations using CloudFormation, Terraform, and related tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Partner with development teams to determine infrastructure requirements, deployment approaches, and operational toolsets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Oversee secrets management and identity systems utilizing AWS IAM and similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Maintain compliance with security and privacy standards, including access controls, encryption protocols, and audit mechanisms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Resolve production incidents across all service layers with a focus on rapid response and thorough post-incident analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Create and maintain automated backup, disaster recovery, and failover systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Research and adopt emerging DevOps methodologies and technologies to enhance platform performance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;10+ years of software engineering background with 6+ years focused on DevOps, Site Reliability Engineering, or Infrastructure Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing production environments with comprehensive infrastructure responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Extensive AWS expertise, including compute, storage, networking, and identity management services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Practical experience with serverless technologies (AWS Lambda, Step Functions, EventBridge, API Gateway, ECS Fargate)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Advanced skills in Docker and container orchestration platforms (Kubernetes, ECS, GKE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Proficiency with CI/CD platforms such as GitHub Actions, CircleCI, ArgoCD, or Jenkins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Strong scripting capabilities in Bash, Python, or Go for automation and tooling development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Experience with observability solutions (Datadog, Prometheus, Grafana, ELK stack)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of network design, security frameworks, and zero-trust access architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Knowledge of secrets management systems and infrastructure-level access policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Exceptional troubleshooting and root cause analysis abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Strong collaborative and communication skills across diverse technical and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;Continuous improvement mindset with focus on automation, optimization, and security enhancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words&quot;&gt;This position offers the opportunity to join an early-stage team with proven success in developing cutting-edge contextual intelligence technology, working alongside talented engineers and product leaders who prioritize innovation and measurable client impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are you waiting for? Fill out the form below and apply!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We are searching for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior .NET Developer&lt;/strong&gt; on behalf of one of our clients, a successful and growing property &amp;amp; casualty insurance software company. The client develops proprietary enterprise solutions that manage the full operational suite for insurance carriers, their agents, and customers. This is an exciting opportunity to work with both established and cutting-edge Microsoft-based technologies, including an active migration to .NET Core and integration of AI tools into real development workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
