&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Contribute to and modernize legacy VB.NET MVC applications while supporting the migration to .NET Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and integrate AI-assisted development workflows using tools such as ChatGPT, Claude, or similar technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate directly with clients to gather requirements, deliver enhancements, and provide technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Write and optimize SQL queries, stored procedures, and database interactions in SQL Server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Participate in Agile development processes using tools like JIRA and Git/TFS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;7–8+ years of full-stack development experience, with the ability to independently own features end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with VB.NET and C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Solid command of ASP.NET MVC architecture — controllers, backend integration, and request lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proficiency in JavaScript, jQuery, and Bootstrap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong SQL Server and T-SQL skills, including stored procedures and query optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with TFS and Visual Studio 2019+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;1–2+ years of hands-on experience using AI tools in a real development workflow (ChatGPT, Claude, OpenWebUI, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to work directly with clients, gathering requirements and translating them into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Self-directed, mature, and comfortable working with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
